<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Flesh He became, the first God-man,</l><l>His pleasure that I God may be:</l><l>In life and nature I’m God’s kind,</l><l>Though Godhead’s His exclusively.</l><l>His attributes my virtues are;</l><l>His glorious image shines through me.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>No longer I alone that live,</l><l>But God together lives with me.</l><l>Built with the saints in the Triune God,</l><l>His universal house we’ll be,</l><l>And His organic Body we</l><l>For His expression corp’rately.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
